	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Mitochondrial carrier homolog 2 (MTCH2) regulates the differentiation of AML cells by controlling pyruvate entry into the mitochondria, nuclear localization of pyruvate dehydrogenase complex and H3 and H4 histone acetylation</Item>
